# Everyone's Grudging's edges. Section 1 off, one operand each (level 75 Warriors in Kazham): bob (fame 487, level 6; A
# Question of Taste completed, rancorCurse 1): Jakoh: A Question of Taste's nil: the default 113; carl (fame 488, A
# Question of Taste accepted, rancorCurse 1): A Question of Taste's 46; dan (fame 488, A Question of Taste completed,
# rancorCurse 1, A Pose By Any Other Name's mustZone 250 set in Kazham): the default; ed (fame 488, A Question of Taste
# completed, rancorCurse 0): the default. Main (accepted by a GM at Prog 2, a Rancor Flame): Den of Rancor: the Torch popped
# (four flames to _4ge) and killed at Prog 2 (not 0): Prog stays 2; the Torch gone (two ticks: the lanterns out), Everyone's
# Grudging set available at Prog 0 (GMs), the Torch popped again and killed: nothing (the death is the accepted
# section's). Not reachable: quest:complete false (a gil reward only).
lists Kazham/Jakoh_Wahcondalo/onTrigger DenOfRancor/Rancor_Torch/onMobDeath
char zone=DenOfRancor pos=119.25,12.904,-319.789 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=Kazham pos=101.702,-15.023,-115.841 job=WAR lvl=75
char carl zone=Kazham pos=101.702,-15.023,-115.841 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=Kazham pos=101.702,-15.023,-115.841 job=WAR lvl=75
char ed zone=Kazham pos=101.702,-15.023,-115.841 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Windurst 488
quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste completed
quest Outlands.EveryonesGrudging accepted
charvar Quest[5][4]Prog 2
