bob: fame Windurst 487
bob: quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste completed
bob: charvar rancorCurse 1
carl: fame Windurst 488
carl: quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste accepted
carl: charvar rancorCurse 1
dan: fame Windurst 488
dan: quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste completed
dan: charvar rancorCurse 1
dan: charvar Quest[2][7]mustZone 250
ed: fame Windurst 488
ed: quest Outlands.AQuestionOfTaste completed
login
bob: login
bob: trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo           # fame level 6: not offered; A Question of Taste nil: the default 113
bob: finish
bob: logout
carl: login
carl: trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo          # A Question of Taste not completed: not offered; its 46
carl: finish
carl: logout
dan: login
dan: trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo           # A Pose's mustZone (250, kept in Kazham): not offered: the default
dan: finish
dan: logout
ed: login
ed: trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo            # rancorCurse 0: not offered: the default
ed: finish
ed: logout
trade _4ge RancorFlame x1               # the first lantern
item RancorFlame                        # a GM
trade _4ge RancorFlame x1
item RancorFlame                        # a GM
trade _4ge RancorFlame x1
item RancorFlame                        # a GM
trade _4ge RancorFlame x1               # the fourth: Rancor Torch spawned, claimed
kill RANCOR_TORCH                       # Prog 2 (not 0): nothing (Prog stays 2)
tick 15000                              # the body despawns
tick 4000                               # it fades: the lanterns go out
quest Outlands.EveryonesGrudging available   # a GM
charvar Quest[5][4]Prog 0               # a GM
item RancorFlame                        # a GM
trade _4ge RancorFlame x1               # the first lantern again
item RancorFlame                        # a GM
trade _4ge RancorFlame x1
item RancorFlame                        # a GM
trade _4ge RancorFlame x1
item RancorFlame                        # a GM
trade _4ge RancorFlame x1               # the fourth: Rancor Torch spawned, claimed
kill RANCOR_TORCH                       # Everyone's Grudging available (Prog 0): no accepted section: nothing
